   "IMPORTED_RESEARCH_MODULES_NOT_IN_B: a research module that the sealing path imports but that is not one of the four in module_source_sha16 -- nfl.research.q7.panel and nfl.research.q8.audit are the live examples -- is in neither B nor E. Remedy: hash each imported module file by content into the candidate identity. That is candidate.py, not this module.",
